        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also manufacture certain complementary products that are used with our lasers, such as optical delivery cables, fiber couplers, beam switches, optical processing heads, process measuring and monitoring technologies and chillers.",
        "start_character": 13601,
        "end_character": 13832
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001111928-26-000040",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001111928-26-000040-7942c2118b29f7d6",
        "accession_number": "0001111928-26-000040",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell complete medical laser systems and fibers to medical technology companies that sell and support our products under their names.",
